1
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Swatting away the buzzing of a fly
Gazing at the wilderness, unsmiling

2
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:31,938
Straining my eyes toward the horizon
Marking the rhythm with the sound of hooves

3
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:39,600
Body temperature rising, stoked by the blazing sun

4
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:45,520
Racing forward, trailing steam like a locomotive — yeah

5
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,450
Boundless talent — look, it’s bursting out
This is the fanged edge gained through the formula

6
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:53,700
Transcending mere competition, refining my aesthetic as I go
It is my true intent

7
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:56,400
Don’t let the golden moment slip right past
Everything slows down

8
00:00:56,400 --> 00:01:00,250
The frontier that remains lies within
I’m large

9
00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:02,600
Spinning, spinning

10
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,900
My brain, just the same as always

11
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:09,200
Stirred up by the rush of excitement

12
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:13,400
Dancing with foolishness

13
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:15,800
Spinning, spinning

14
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:19,100
The scenery, just the same as always

15
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:22,300
Swallowing it all down

16
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:27,700
I want to find acceptance in it
